\cf2 \cb5 I went with Python for this first implementation: no third-party Python dependencies, straightforward to inspect and modify, and easy to port the durable pieces to Rust later.\cf0 \cb1 \
\cf2 \cb5 This isn't pseudocode. I generated the CLI, ran it against actual temporary Git repositories, verified the resulting Merkle hashes, modified files to test tamper detection, and successfully resealed them.\cf0 \cb1 \
